<title>SOUTH KOREA: SK Telecom H1 net rises 4.7 pct.</title>
<headline>SK Telecom H1 net rises 4.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				  27,219 vs 27,238</p>
<p>    Net					   163.6 vs 156.3</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 223.3 vs 225.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				  1,595.8 vs 1,027.2</p>
<p>NOTE - SK Telecom Co Ltd, a unit of the Sunkyong Group, attributed the sales rise to a strong growth in cellular and paging operations.</p>
<p>The company said its share capital rose by 175,063 shares to 6.01 million shares in the first six months of this year.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
